{"id":"en_my-thoughts-are-louder-than-your-schemes","title":"My Thoughts Are Louder Than Your Schemes","titleEn":"My Thoughts Are Louder Than Your Schemes","description":"Wendy Trent lost everything in her previous life: Holly Trent, the false heiress, framed her, those around her turned against her, her family fell into ruin, and she ended up drowning in the sea. Given a second chance, she returns to the moment before the Trent family acknowledges her and resolves to rewrite her destiny—only to discover that her relatives can now hear what she is thinking. Drawing on what she remembers from her earlier life, she strikes back at Holly one move at a time, gradually stripping away her pretenses and revealing who she really is, while also finding love along the way.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/my-thoughts-are-louder-than-your-schemes/en_US/535fc5f87e108994/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/my-thoughts-are-louder-than-your-schemes/en_US/535fc5f87e108994/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Avenge","Face-Slap","Heiress Drama","High Society","Out-of-the-Box","Urban"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dlgai/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_my-thoughts-are-louder-than-your-schemes_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dlgai/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_my-thoughts-are-louder-than-your-schemes_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dlgai/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_my-thoughts-are-louder-than-your-schemes_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dlgai/?pub=4occak",